<main class="pack-site pack-practice mint-site"><section class="mint-hero"><img src="/assets/starters/team.webp" width="1280" height="853" alt="{{ english ? 'Fictional practice team' : 'Fiktives Praxisteam' }}" fetchpriority="high"><div class="mint-hero-copy"><p class="mint-kicker">{{ brand }} · {{ english ? 'Family practice' : 'Familienpraxis' }}</p><h1>{{ english ? 'Time to listen.
