formation and simple appointment planning together, so every visit feels a little more familiar.' : 'Ein gutes Gespräch beginnt mit Zuhören. Unsere Demonstrationspraxis verbindet hilfreiche Informationen mit einer einfachen Terminplanung.' }}</p><a class="pack-button" href="{{ base }}{{ english ? 'en/' : '' }}about/">{{ english ? 'Meet the team' : 'Unser Team kennenlernen' }}</a></div><img src="/assets/starters/doctor.webp" width="1280" height="853" alt="{{ english ? 'Fictional practitioner' : 'Fiktive Ärztin' }}" loading="lazy"></section><section class="mint-section"><div class="mint-wrap"><h2>{{ english ? 'Your next visit, made simple' : 'Ihr nächster Besuch. Einfach geplant.' }}</h2><div class="mint-grid two"><img src="/assets/starters/reception.webp" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy" alt="{{ english ? 'Fictional reception' : 'Fiktiver Empfang' }}"><div class="mint-steps">{% for title,copy in (english ? {'Choose a time':'Explore the demonstration calendar and choose an available appointment.','Receive a confirmation':'The booking confirmation includes a link to cancel your demo reservation.','Plan ahead':'Find directions, opening hours and information before your visit.'} : {'Termin auswählen':'Wählen Sie einen freien Termin im Demonstrationskalender.','Bestätigung erhalten':'Die Bestätigung enthält einen Link zur Stornierung Ihrer Demo-Reservierung.','Besuch planen':'Informieren Sie sich über Anreise, Öffnungszeiten und den Ablauf.'}) %}<article><h3>{{ title }}</h3><p>{{ copy }}</p></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></div></section><section class="mint-split light"><img src="/assets/starters/coordinator.webp" width="1280" height="853" alt="{{ english ? 'Fictional reception coordinator' : 'Fiktive Empfangsmitarbeiterin' }}" loading="lazy"><div><p class="mint-kicker">{{ english ? 'Stay connected' : 'Wir sind für Sie da' }}</p><h2>{{ english ? 'A welcoming place. A clear next step.' : 'Ein freundlicher Ort. Ein klarer nächster Schritt.' }}</h2><p>{{ english ? 'Browse our services or explore the working booking demonstration.' : 'Entdecken Sie unsere Leistungen und die funktionierende Terminbuchung.' }}</p><a class="pack-button" href="/booking/?lang={{ english ? 'en' : 'de' }}">{{ english ? 'Find an appointment' : 'Termin finden' }}</a></div></section><section class="mint-section"><div class="mint-wrap"><h2>{{ english ? 'From the practice journal' : 'Aus unserem Praxis-Journal' }}</h2><div class="mint-grid">{% for row in (english ? [['consultation','Preparing for your first visit','preparing-first-visit'],['reception','A look inside the practice','inside-the-practice'],['coordinator','Simple appointment planning','appointment-planning']] : [['consultation','Gut vorbereitet zum ersten Besuch','preparing-first-visit'],['reception','Ein Blick in unsere Praxis','inside-the-practice'],['coordinator','Termine einfach planen','appointment-planning']]) %}{% set image=row[0] %}{% set title=row[1] %}{% set copy=row[2]|default('') %}{% set path=row[2]|default('') %}<article class="mint-card"><img src="/assets/starters/{{ image }}.webp" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="mint-card-body"><p class="mint-kicker">{{ english ? 'Practice notes' : 'Praxisnotizen' }}</p><h3>{{ title }}</h3><p>{{ english ? 'A closer look at our fictional practice and how visits are organised.' : 'Ein Einblick in unsere fiktive Praxis und die Organisation Ihres Besuchs.' }}</p><a class="pack-button" href="{{ english ? '/en/articles/' : '/artikel/' }}{{ path }}/">{{ english ? 'Read post' : 'Artikel lesen' }}</a></div></article>{% endfor %}</div><p style="margin-top:28px"><a href="{{ english ? '/en/articles/' : '/artikel/' }}">{{ english ? 'See all articles' : 'Alle Artikel ansehen' }} {% include 'starters/arrow.html.twig' %}</a></p></div></section>{% include 'starters/rail.html.twig' %}</main>